Greetings,

As you are aware, the State Officers will be doing their Chapter visit for
Gelndale, VOTS, and Phoenix on Sunday, September 13th.

During rhe visit, the State Officers will ask the Advisors to breakaway as
they hold a presentation with the members.

Please encourage all of your members to attend this meeting.

During the breakaway, I would like to have a meeting with the Advisors to
go over some important information.

It is imperative that all Chapter Dads and Chapter Chairmen from all three
Chapters attend this meeting on the 13th as I want to discuss a plan to
grow the membership so that Phoenix and VOTS can function independently.

Please encourage get the word out to your advisors to attend as well.

I look forward to working together to formulate a plan.    It is vital that
all of you are there to contribute your thoughts and be aware of and have
an understanding of the plan.

Regards,
Steve

*Steve Johnston*

*Executive Officer*

Arizona DeMolay State Association

3535 East Blanche Drive, Phoenix, AZ 85032
(602) 931-3403
executive.officer@azdemolay.org   www.azdemolay.org

